# fixedbugs, defect 559, lane b18-ffi, 2026-10-10 (panel 202's C0; the
# critic's `skew64sw`).
#
# The case beside this one with its group also binding a function, so its
# header comes before the other module's in the program's list of headers,
# the other order of the two. Told the same words: the record is laid out
# as this module's own unit reads it, whichever header the program names
# first. The base told this order truly already; it is kept so both orders
# are pinned.
use fixedbugs559/wide

extern "fixedbugs-559-skew.h"
    record S
        a: i64  #~ ffi_field_type
        b: i32
    function sget(s: S) -> i32

function main()
    s = S(a: 1, b: 2)
    print(wide.doubled(x: 3) + s.a)
    print(sget(s: s))
